# Raw/intermediate data not read by the dashboard at runtime (only
# rag_corpus_final.jsonl, chroma_db/, and dashboard_summary_cache.json are --
# see the Dockerfile's explicit COPY lines and src/dashboard_*.py). Named
# individually rather than ignoring data/ wholesale, since Docker's ignore
# negation (!pattern) for files inside an excluded parent directory is
# unreliable across engine versions.
